wer, I should look for the closest match. The VLM doesn\'t mention any cow or bird in this scene, but it does show the cat and dog are part of the group being chased.\n\nLet me check if there\'s any evidence of him specifically chasing one animal over others by examining the frames more closely.\n\n```json\n{\n    "tool": "EXTRACT_FINE_GRAINED_FRAMES",\n    "start_second": 495,\n    "end_second": 500,\n    "fps": 5\n}\n```'}, {'role': 'fine frames extraction', 'content': 'Successfully extracted 25 fine-grained frames from 495s to 500s at 5 FPS.\n\nDuration: 5.0 seconds\nFrame interval: 0.20s\n\nExtracted frames:\n  - frames/detailed_frame_0495.00.jpg\n  - frames/detailed_frame_0495.20.jpg\n  - frames/detailed_frame_0495.40.jpg\n  - frames/detailed_frame_0495.60.jpg\n  - frames/detailed_frame_0495.80.jpg\n  - frames/detailed_frame_0496.00.jpg\n  - frames/detailed_frame_0496.20.jpg\n  - frames/detailed_frame_0496.40.jpg\n  - frames/detailed_frame_0496.60.jpg\n  - frames/detailed_frame_0496.80.jpg\n  ... and 15 more frames\n\nYou can now use these frames with VLM_QUERY to analyze fine details like hand motions, quick actions, or subtle movements.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '```json\n{\n    "tool": "VLM_QUERY",\n    "frames": [\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0495.00.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0495.20.jpg", \n        "frames/detailed_frame_0495.40.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0495.60.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0495.80.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0496.00.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0496.20.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0496.40.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0496.60.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0496.80.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0497.00.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0497.20.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0497.40.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0497.60.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0497.80.jpg",\n        "frames/detailed_frame_0498.00.jpg",\n        "