his confirms they are being pursued as a unit. The man's actions in the preceding frames are consistent with this context; he is the pursuer of the entire ensemble.\n\nIn conclusion, the man's pursuit is indiscriminate. He is running after the entire group of characters, and his body language does not suggest any preferential targeting of one animal over another."}], 'formatted_responses': ["\n=== Batch 0-20 (20 frames) ===\nFrames: /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0495.00.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0495.20.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0495.40.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0495.60.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0495.80.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0496.00.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0496.20.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0496.40.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0496.60.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0496.80.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0497.00.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0497.20.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0497.40.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0497.60.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0497.80.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0498.00.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0498.20.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/pXD3txG2bVQ/frames/detailed_frame_0498.40.jpg, /mnt/ssd/data/l